compute job each for its vertex and fragment shader (STARBITE_PANVK_CPU_DESC=1; without it, unchanged), and counters of the
draws and of the copies (jobs or CPU) for the starbite-drm shim's statistics line. docs/ios27/PERFORMANCE.md section 7.
